        <p>
          The site and content are provided as-is and as-available. Pengo Systems
          does not guarantee accuracy, availability, completeness, or fitness for
          a specific purpose.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Responsibility for Use</h2>
        <p>
          You are responsible for how you use or rely on site content. Pengo Systems
          is not responsible for decisions, actions, workflows, claims, losses, or
          consequences resulting from use of the site or its content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
        <p>
          The site may link to third-party services or resources. Pengo Systems is
          not responsible for third-party content, policies, or availability.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions, contact <a href="mailto:info@pengosystems.com">info@pengosystems.com</a>.
          For billing questions, contact <a href="mailto:billing@pengosystems.com">billing@pengosystems.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</PengoLayout>
